u-ji Temple a place of golden glow\nWhere Zen philosophy doth unfold in its tranquil flow\nThen take a stroll through the Arashiyama Bamboo Forest's might\nAnd behold the beauty of its natural delight\n\nDay the Ninth\nVisit the Nijo Castle a place of samurai renown\nWhere secret passages do hide in its ancient stone\nThen take a stroll through the Kyoto Imperial Palace's grounds\nAnd behold the beauty of its tranquil surrounds\n\nDay the Tenth\nTake a train to Hiroshima a city of peace\nWhere the Atomic Bomb Dome doth stand in a bygone age's release\nVisit the Hiroshima Peace Memorial Park a place of sorrow and pain\nAnd learn of its history in the stories that do remain\n\nDay the Eleventh\nVisit the Miyajima Island a place of natural delight\nWhere Itsukushima Shrine doth stand on the waves of the morning light\nThen take a stroll through the island's scenic grounds\nAnd behold the beauty of its tranquil surrounds\n\nDay the Twelfth\nReturn to Tokyo and depart from its busy gate\nWhere memories of thy journey do await thy eager state.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Fair", "logprob": -0.08163616}, {"token": " traveler", "logprob": -0.079575405}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -0.17345776}, {"token": " see", "logprob": -0.1606858}, {"token": "kest", "logprob": -9.97732e-05}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.85221833}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.5111953}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.19632839}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.062069237}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.10045276}, {"token": " shore", "logprob": -1.0498961}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.11570101}, {"token": "Where", "logprob": -1.8350482}, {"token": " cherry", "logprob": -0.88868856}, {"token": " bloss", "logprob": -0.007185332}, {"token": "oms", "logprob": -4.887569e-06}, {"token": " bloom", "logprob": -0.15539758}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.35543928}, {"token": " honor", "logprob": -0.8959651}, {"token": " do", "logprob": -1.915472}, {"token": "th", "logprob": -0.0013722299}, {"token": " po